#descr "The centaur was a large creature that lived in temperate forests. They could be found living solitary lives but more often lived in small tribes. These tribes typically followed the advice of the wisest and most gifted in their community, and those who could most reliable ensure a steady supply of good food and strong drink. Centaurs had to eat a lot to fuel their large bodies and were known to overindulge, especially with wine and ale. A drunken centaur was much more prone to aggressive and violent behavior.

